":"900"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"48f9fa8","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p class="cp-lead" style="color:#F5F3EE">業種や枚数を問わず、使い道に合わせてアイテムと刷り方をご提案します。</p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"112e44a","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<div class="cp-grid g4"><a class="cp-card" href="/estimate/"><span class="cp-no">USE 01</span><h3>お店・会社のユニフォーム</h3><p>スタッフでそろえるTシャツやワークシャツ。枚数が多いほど、シルクの1枚あたりが下がります。</p><span class="cp-more">見積もる →</span></a><a class="cp-card" href="/estimate/"><span class="cp-no">USE 02</span><h3>チーム・サークル・部活</h3><p>おそろいのTシャツやパーカーを、少人数から。デザインの相談もできます。</p><span class="cp-more">見積もる →</span></a><a class="cp-card" href="/estimate/"><span class="cp-no">USE 03</span><h3>周年記念・イベント</h3><p>記念Tシャツやスタッフ用ウェアに。使う日が決まっているときは、先に日程をご相談ください。</p><span class="cp-more">見積もる →</span></a><a class="cp-card hot" href="/estimate/"><span class="cp-no">USE 04</span><h3>AIアート・ZINE・イベント物販、1枚から</h3><p>AIで作った絵や自作のイラストを、1枚から形に。濃い色のボディもDTFなら割安です。解像度や背景など、刷れるデータへの調整はデザイナー本人が見ます。売れた分だけ追加もOK。</p><span class="cp-more">1枚から見積もる →</span></a></div>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"95e3bbb","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":18,"column":"18","row":"18","isLinked":true},"background_background":"classic","background_color":"#F5F3EE","css_classes":"cp-sec cp-light","_element_id":"method","border_border":"solid","border_width":{"unit":"px","top":"2","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"border_color":"#111111"},"elements":[{"id":"63834e0","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p class='cp-label'>刷り方の選び方</p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"5bdcf5a","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"シルク・DTG・DTF。<br>枚数とデザインで、いちばん合う方法を。","header_size":"h2","_css_classes":"cp-h2","title_color":"#111111","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Noto Sans JP","typography_font_weight":"900"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"6a8acce","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<div class='cp-grid'><div class='cp-card cp-method' style='--m:#1F8A6B'><span class='cp-no'>METHOD 01</span><h3>シルクスクリーン</h3><p>版を作ってインクを刷り重ねる、昔ながらの方法。色数が少なく枚数が多いほど、1枚あたりが安くなります。発色がよく丈夫です。</p><span class='cp-more'>向いている：ユニフォーム・数の多い物販</span></div><div class='cp-card cp-method' style='--m:#E0482A'><span class='cp-no'>METHOD 02</span><h3>DTG（インクジェット）</h3><p>版を作らず、フルカラーで直接刷ります。写真やグラデーションも1枚から。色数で値段が変わりません。</p><span class='cp-more'>向いている：写真・イラスト・少ない枚数</span></div><div class='cp-card cp-method' style='--m:#2F6DB5'><span class='cp-no'>METHOD 03</span><h3>DTF（転写）</h3><p>フルカラーの絵柄をシートに刷って熱で圧着します。濃い色のボディでも白とほぼ同じ値段。小さな絵柄やそでにも。</p><span class='cp-more'>向いている：濃色ボディ・AIアート・少ない枚数</span></div></div><div class='cp-curve'><div><span class='cp-label'>CROPRIだけの比較機能</span><h3>刷り方ごとの価格曲線</h3><p>見積もり画面では、「枚数」と「1枚あたりの価格」を、シルク・DTG・DTFの3本の線で見比べられます。絵の大きさや色数を変えると線が動くので、何枚からどの刷り方が安くなるかがひと目でわかります。お客様に合う刷り方を、正直におすすめするための機能です。</p><div class='cp-btns'><a class='cp-btn cp-btn-main' href='/estimate/'>価格曲線で比べる <span aria-hidden='true'>→</span></a></div></div><div><svg viewBox='0 0 600 340' role='img' aria-label='枚数と1枚あたりの価格を3つの刷り方で比べるグラフのイメージ'><line x1='60' y1='20' x2='60' y2='290' stroke='#111' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='60' y1='290' x2='580' y2='290' stroke='#111' stroke-width='2'/><text x='66' y='34' font-size='15' fill='#111'>1枚あたりの価格</text><text x='580' y='318' font-size='15' fill='#111' text-anchor='end'>枚数 →</text><path d='M70 40 C 120 190, 200 240, 570 268' fill='none' stroke='#1F8A6B' stroke-width='5'/><path d='M70 120 C 150 165, 300 180, 570 196' fill='none' stroke='#E0482A' stroke-width='5'/><path d='M70 135 C 160 180, 300 200, 570 214' fill='none' stroke='#2F6DB5' stroke-width='5' stroke-dasharray='14 7'/><g font-size='15' font-weight='700'><rect x='392' y='30' width='14' height='14' fill='#1F8A6B'/><text x='412' y='43' fill='#111'>シルク</text><rect x='392' y='56' width='14' height='14' fill='#E0482A'/><text x='412' y='69' fill='#111'>DTG</text><rect x='392' y='82' width='14' height='14' fill='#2F6DB5'/><text x='412' y='95' fill='#111'>DTF</text></g></svg><p class='cp-note'>※線の形はイメージです。実際の金額は見積もり画面で計算されます。</p></div></div>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"a3eccb6","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"row","flex_justify_content":"space-between","flex_align_items":"center","background_background":"classic","background_color":"#F5F3EE","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"40","right":"48","bottom":"40","left":"48","isLinked":false},"padding_tablet":{"unit":"px","top":"40","right":"32","bottom":"40","left":"32","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"36","right":"20","bottom":"36","left":"20","isLinked":false},"flex_direction_tablet":"column","flex_direction_mobile":"column","flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":32,"column":"32","row":"32","isLinked":true},"_element_id":"flow"},"elements":[{"id":"01c3a96","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","flex_align_items":"flex-start","flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":6,"column":"6","row":"6","isLinked":true},"width":{"unit":"px","size":190,"sizes":[]},"width_tablet":{"unit":"%","size":100,"sizes":[]},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"32","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"padding_tablet":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"border_border":"solid","border_width":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"1","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"border_width_tablet":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"border_color":"#111111","flex_align_items_tablet":"center","_flex_size":"none"},"elements":[{"id":"1fdbc55","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"HOW TO ORDER","align":"left","title_color":"#F04B2A","align_tablet":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Noto Sans JP","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":12,"sizes":[]},"